---
description: Core rules for the Next.js multi-purpose admin template
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` and `README-AI.md`.

Architecture:
- Keep routes thin.
- Put business logic under `features/`.
- Put reusable UI under `components/`.
- Put configuration under `config/`.
- Put infrastructure under `lib/`.
- Prefer Server Components.
- Use Client Components only where necessary.

Quality:
- TypeScript strict.
- No unnecessary `any`.
- Responsive.
- Accessible.
- Dark/light/system themes.
- Loading/empty/error states.
- Reuse existing components.
- Avoid unnecessary dependencies.
- Do not add comments to every line.
